  "description": "The Magna Gravel Blaster 12-inch Boys Bike by Dynacraft is the perfect choice for young riders who are ready to cut up some dust. With a sleek black finish on the frame and vibrant blue accents on the handlebars and chain guard, this bike looks as cool as it rides. Custom graphics add an extra touch of style and excitement. The coaster brakes make stopping easy, while the removable/adjustable training wheels help ensure a fun and stable ride for kids. Plus, the adjustable seat means that the bike can grow with your child. Whether your little one is just starting out or already has some riding experience, the Magna Gravel Blaster 12-inch Boys Bike is an excellent option for male riders aged 3-5 years. Get ready for hours of fun and adventure with this awesome bike!",
